{"version":1,"key":"card:255","content":{"id":255,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在实际中我们经常需要将对象转化为原始类型，例如对一个对象做加法，那么就会触发将对象转化为原始类型的步骤。根据对象需要转化为数字还是字符串，有两种不同的行为。如果需要转化为数字，遵循以下步骤："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"调用对象的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"valueOf","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，如果返回的是原始类型，则返回"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"否则，调用对象的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"toString","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，如果返回的是原始类型，则返回"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"否则，抛出错误"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果需要转化为字符串的话，遵循以下步骤"}]},{"type":"numbered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"调用对象的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"toString","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，如果返回的是原始类型，则返回"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"否则，调用对象的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"valueOf","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，如果返回的是原始类型，则返回"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"否则，抛出错误"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"大多数情况下都是默认转化为数字，少数对象如 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Date","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象默认转化为字符串。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们发现转化为数字和字符串时 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"valueOf","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"toString","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法的调用顺序不同，为了统一将对象转化为对象的行为，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Symbol.toPrimitive","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 覆盖默认的转化顺序，以统一转化行为。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Symbol.toPrimitive","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法接收一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"hint","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 作为参数，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"hint","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是一个字符串，它只有三种取值"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"string","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"number","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"default","code":true}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"根据对象需要被转化为什么类型的原始字符串，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"hint","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的取值不同，例如当对象处在需要转化为数字的上下文中，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"hint ","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"的值就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"number","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，需要转化为字符串时，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"hint","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"string","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当不确定需要转化为什么时(例如加法运算，既可以用于字符串连接，也可以用于数字相加)，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"hint","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"default","code":true}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"let obj = {\n  [Symbol.toPrimitive]: function (hint) {\n    switch (hint) {\n      case \"number\":\n        return 10;\n      case \"string\":\n        return \"hello\";\n      case \"default\":\n        return \"default\";\n      default:\n        throw new Error();\n    }\n  },\n};\n\nconst print = console.log;\nprint(1 * obj); // 10\nprint(`${obj}`); // hello\nprint(obj + \"\"); // default","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"5f0ff2b3-a953-444e-96b6-715725aaf845","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"],"createTime":1690987159912,"updateTime":1743303640421,"linkedCards":[{"id":249,"target":{"key":"card:249","type":"card","id":249},"summary":"Symbol 是 ES6 引入的一种新的原始类型，类型的值唯一的，每个被创建出来的 Symbol 变量都是不同的，这是 Symbol 这种数据类型最大的特点，常常用于作为对象的属性，以防止被不正确篡改。 Symbol 不能通过字面量来进行创...","tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640421}}